'''dot''', also known as ''Murz1k'', is a professional Quakeworld player from Saint Petersburg.
Always in love with PC shooters, he found ''q3test'' in [[1999]] and later Quake 3 which he played up until [[2001]] when he fell for the fast and dynamic gameplay of QW [[FFA]].

In the wake of great Russian players like {{Player|doom|flag=ru}}, {{Player|unknown|flag=ru}} and {{Player|ded|flag=ru}}, dot slowly began practising to get to the highest levels.

